<article class="env-lemma" id="0FLY">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0FLY">Lemma <span data-tag="0FLY">50.3.3</span>.</a> Let $p : X \to S$ be a proper morphism of schemes with $S$ locally Noetherian. Then $Rp_*\Omega ^\bullet _{X/S}$ is an object of $D_{\textit{Coh}}(\mathcal{O}_ S)$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      In this case by Morphisms, Lemma <a href="/tag/01V2" data-tag="01V2">29.33.12</a> the modules $\Omega ^ i_{X/S}$ are coherent. Hence we can use exactly the same argument as in the proof of Lemma <a href="/tag/0FLX" data-tag="0FLX">50.3.2</a> using Cohomology of Schemes, Proposition <a href="/tag/02O5" data-tag="02O5">30.19.1</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>